  "title": "Square — unary u8",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Square — unary u8",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "Square possède une seule entrée canonique in (anciens alias a/value conservés). Avec 3, la sortie result vaut 9. Ce n'est pas la fenêtre math.gating.square.\nEntrées : in (u8) = 3.\nRésultats attendus : result (u8) = 9.\n\nNumeric scalar, array or recursively numeric cluster; result preserves aggregate structure.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: explicit private Simulation; not a compiled-native claim.\nExpected:\noutput-result (u8) = 9\n",
    "author": "",
    "automatic_versioning": false,
    "program_version": "0.0.0.0",
    "tags": ["numeric-math", "typed-values", "independent-oracle", "explicit-private-simulation", "example"],
